    "title": "Lexington man arrested for stabbing, robbery previously convicted of hit-and-run that killed officer - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Madylin Goins ,\n1 days ago LEXINGTON, Ky. (FOX 56) — Lexington police have arrested a man in connection with a late March stabbing. The Lexington Police Department said officers were dispatched around 11 p.m. on March 29 to the 700 block of North Broadway after someone had been stabbed. The victim told officers they were being followed after leaving a nearby gas station. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
